Liquid Neon wallpapers — PNG originals
======================================

The 42 PNGs in `originals/` are owner-authored: Skyy generated them himself with
an AI image generator and supplied them to engineering on 2026-09-09. Wholly
owned, no stock-library licence, no third-party rights holder, no attribution
requirement. Confirmed by Skyy on 2026-09-09 (SKY-11591).

The canonical licence record — the one that covers redistribution inside the
installer — is kept next to the assets that actually ship:

    frontend/src/assets/wallpapers/LICENSE

Keep that file authoritative and this one a pointer, so the two cannot drift.

These originals are the design source of truth and are NEVER packaged.
`electron-builder.json` sets `files: ["out/**/*", "package.json"]`, so only what
the renderer build emits reaches the installer — this directory sits outside that
tree by construction, not by an ignore rule.

`originals/PROVENANCE.json` records, per staged PNG, the owner's original folder
and filename plus a SHA-256 of the bytes, so any shipped wallpaper can be traced
back to the file the owner handed over.

Pipeline notes: docs/design/wallpaper-pipeline.md
